s6-1-p39 = prose (cons "Dimension substitution can select a face of a system, change which boundary is available, or expose a composition rule. The face context therefore participates in the validity of a residual. Branches whose premises do not hold must not be forced merely to build a cache key or inspect a system. Dimension and face payloads retain their distinct algebraic meanings." nil)
